<section class="bestsellers" id="bestsellers"><div class="section"><div class="section-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE ONES YOU'LL REACH FOR, ON REPEAT</div><h2>{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ section.settings.collection.url | default: '/collections/all' }}">EXPLORE ALL ↗</a></div>{% assign featured = section.settings.collection %}{% if featured != blank and featured.products_count > 0 %}<div class="products">{% for product in featured.products limit: section.settings.limit %}{% render 'product-card', product: product %}{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<div class="products">{% assign sample_product = all_products['zenv-velvet-muse-matte-lipstick'] %}{% if sample_product != blank %}{% render 'product-card', product: sample_product %}{% else %}<article class="product-card" data-category="lips"><div class="product-image"><img src="{{ 'zenv-product-01.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" alt="Velvet Muse Matte Lipstick — AI-generated concept"><span class="badge">ZENV DEMO</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>Velvet Muse Matte Lipstick</h3><p>Rosewood colour. A softly defined look.</p><div class="price">{{ 49900 | money }}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="button light" disabled>ADD TO CART</button><button class="button" disabled>BUY NOW</button></div><details class="product-description"><summary>Product details +</summary><p>Meet your everyday statement shade. Velvet Muse brings a rosewood-inspired colour story to a classic bullet lipstick, dressed in Zenv’s signature plum and gold packaging. Pair it with a clean eye look for a simple daytime edit, or build your look around a more defined lip.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Apply from the centre of the lips outwards. Blot and reapply to build your preferred look.</p></details></div></article>{% endif %}{% assign sample_product = all_products['zenv-dew-drop-lip-glaze'] %}{% if sample_product != blank %}{% render 'product-card', product: sample_product %}{% else %}<article class="product-card" data-category="lips"><div class="product-image"><img src="{{ 'zenv-product-02.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" alt="Dew Drop Lip Glaze — AI-generated concept"><span class="badge">ZENV DEMO</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>Dew Drop Lip Glaze</h3><p>A rose-pink touch of shine.</p><div class="price">{{ 44900 | money }}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="button light" disabled>ADD TO CART</button><button class="button" disabled>BUY NOW</button></div><details class="product-description"><summary>Product details +</summary><p>A rose-pink lip gloss concept made for your finishing touch. Wear Dew Drop alone for a fresh, glossy look, or layer it over your favourite lipstick to add dimension. The clear tube and plum cap make it a beautiful addition to your makeup shelf.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Sweep a small amount over the lips using the applicator. Layer over lipstick for a glossy finish.</p></details></div></article>{% endif %}{% assign sample_product = all_products['zenv-second-skin-foundation'] %}{% if sample_product != blank %}{% render 'product-card', product: sample_product %}{% else %}<article class="product-card" data-category="face"><div class="product-image"><img src="{{ 'zenv-product-03.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" alt="Second Skin Foundation — AI-generated concept"><span class="badge">ZENV DEMO</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>Second Skin Foundation</h3><p>Your everyday base, in Warm Beige.</p><div class="price">{{ 79900 | money }}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="button light" disabled>ADD TO CART</button><button class="button" disabled>BUY NOW</button></div><details class="product-description"><summary>Product details +</summary><p>Build your beauty routine around a Warm Beige foundation concept in a frosted glass bottle. Second Skin is imagined as an everyday base for a softly polished makeup look. Use a little for a simple routine, then finish with your choice of cheek and lip colour.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Choose a shade that matches your skin. Start with a small amount and blend from the centre of the face outwards.</p></details></div></article>{% endif %}{% assign sample_product = all_products['zenv-soft-focus-cream-blush'] %}{% if sample_product != blank %}{% render 'product-card', product: sample_product %}{% else %}<article class="product-card" data-category="face"><div class="product-image"><img src="{{ 'zenv-product-04.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" alt="Soft Focus Cream Blush — AI-generated concept"><span class="badge">ZENV DEMO</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>Soft Focus Cream Blush</h3><p>Dusty rose for your cheek colour edit.</p><div class="price">{{ 54900 | money }}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="button light" disabled>ADD TO CART</button><button class="button" disabled>BUY NOW</button></div><details class="product-description"><summary>Product details +</summary><p>A dusty-rose cream blush concept for a fresh pop of cheek colour. Soft Focus comes in a plum compact with a pale-gold rim, ready to join your everyday makeup ritual. Pair it with rose-toned lips for a coordinated look or let the cheeks be your main colour moment.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Pick up a small amount with a brush or fingertip. Tap onto the cheeks and blend to your preferred intensity.</p></details></div></article>{% endif %}{% assign sample_product = all_products['zenv-midnight-line-kajal'] %}{% if sample_product != blank %}{% render 'product-card', product: sample_product %}{% else %}<article class="product-card" data-category="eyes"><div class="product-image"><img src="{{ 'zenv-product-05.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" alt="Midnight Line Kajal — AI-generated concept"><span class="badge">ZENV DEMO</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>Midnight Line Kajal</h3><p>Classic black. Your signature eye.</p><div class="price">{{ 24900 | money }}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="button light" disabled>ADD TO CART</button><button class="button" disabled>BUY NOW</button></div><details class="product-description"><summary>Product details +</summary><p>A classic black kajal pencil concept for eye looks that feel like you. Midnight Line is imagined for a defined lash-line look or a softly smudged effect. Its slim plum pencil and understated gold details keep the Zenv collection feeling coordinated.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Trace gently along the external lash line. Smudge with an appropriate eye brush if a softer look is desired.</p></details></div></article>{% endif %}{% assign sample_product = all_products['zenv-sky-lift-mascara'] %}{% if sample_product != blank %}{% render 'product-card', product: sample_product %}{% else %}<article class="product-card" data-category="eyes"><div class="product-image"><img src="{{ 'zenv-product-06.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" alt="Sky Lift Mascara — AI-generated concept"><span class="badge">ZENV DEMO</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>Sky Lift Mascara</h3><p>The finishing touch to your eye look.</p><div class="price">{{ 59900 | money }}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="button light" disabled>ADD TO CART</button><button class="button" disabled>BUY NOW</button></div><details class="product-description"><summary>Product details +</summary><p>A deep-black mascara concept with a classic brush wand and signature Zenv packaging. Sky Lift is your eye-edit finishing step, whether you are keeping your makeup simple or pairing it with liner and shadow. The plum-and-gold tube brings a little polish to your beauty bag.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Brush from the base of the upper lashes towards the tips. Let each light layer settle before adding more.</p></details></div></article>{% endif %}{% assign sample_product = all_products['zenv-everyday-muse-eye-palette'] %}{% if sample_product != blank %}{% render 'product-card', product: sample_product %}{% else %}<article class="product-card" data-category="eyes"><div class="product-image"><img src="{{ 'zenv-product-07.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" alt="Everyday Muse Eye Palette — AI-generated concept"><span class="badge">ZENV DEMO</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>Everyday Muse Eye Palette</h3><p>Six warm tones. Endless inspiration.</p><div class="price">{{ 99900 | money }}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="button light" disabled>ADD TO CART</button><button class="button" disabled>BUY NOW</button></div><details class="product-description"><summary>Product details +</summary><p>One palette, six warm-toned colour ideas. Everyday Muse brings together champagne, nude, rose, terracotta, cocoa and deep brown in a compact plum case. Explore a simple wash of colour or combine the deeper and lighter shades for a more defined evening look.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Apply a light shade across the lid, add a deeper shade where you want definition, and blend the edges with a clean brush.</p></details></div></article>{% endif %}{% assign sample_product = all_products['zenv-halo-glow-highlighter'] %}{% if sample_product != blank %}{% render 'product-card', product: sample_product %}{% else %}<article class="product-card" data-category="face"><div class="product-image"><img src="{{ 'zenv-product-08.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" alt="Halo Glow Highlighter — AI-generated concept"><span class="badge">ZENV DEMO</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>Halo Glow Highlighter</h3><p>A champagne-inspired finishing accent.</p><div class="price">{{ 64900 | money }}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="button light" disabled>ADD TO CART</button><button class="button" disabled>BUY NOW</button></div><details class="product-description"><summary>Product details +</summary><p>A champagne-toned pressed highlighter concept in a gold-rimmed plum compact. Halo Glow is imagined as the finishing accent to your makeup look: a little light on the cheekbones, a little extra dimension in your colour story. Keep it subtle or build your look around it.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Use a small face brush to sweep a little product onto the high points of the cheeks. Build the look gradually.</p></details></div></article>{% endif %}{% assign sample_product = all_products['zenv-cloud-prep-face-primer'] %}{% if sample_product != blank %}{% render 'product-card', product: sample_product %}{% else %}<article class="product-card" data-category="skin"><div class="product-image"><img src="{{ 'zenv-product-09.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" alt="Cloud Prep Face Primer — AI-generated concept"><span class="badge">ZENV DEMO</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>Cloud Prep Face Primer</h3><p>Start your makeup ritual here.</p><div class="price">{{ 69900 | money }}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="button light" disabled>ADD TO CART</button><button class="button" disabled>BUY NOW</button></div><details class="product-description"><summary>Product details +</summary><p>A face-primer concept in a frosted bottle with a plum pump and pale-gold collar. Cloud Prep is imagined as the first step in your Zenv makeup routine, before your choice of foundation and colour. A quiet little beginning to your everyday beauty ritual.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Start with clean skin. Apply a small amount before foundation, avoiding the eye area.</p></details></div></article>{% endif %}{% assign sample_product = all_products['zenv-essential-brush-set'] %}{% if sample_product != blank %}{% render 'product-card', product: sample_product %}{% else %}<article class="product-card" data-category="tools"><div class="product-image"><img src="{{ 'zenv-product-10.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" alt="The Essential Brush Set — AI-generated concept"><span class="badge">ZENV DEMO</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>The Essential Brush Set</h3><p>Five brushes for your daily beauty edit.</p><div class="price">{{ 89900 | money }}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="button light" disabled>ADD TO CART</button><button class="button" disabled>BUY NOW</button></div><details class="product-description"><summary>Product details +</summary><p>A five-piece makeup brush concept with plum handles, pale-gold ferrules and softly coloured bristles. The Essential Brush Set includes a powder brush, an angled cheek brush and three smaller brushes for eye and detail work. A coordinated toolkit for exploring your favourite makeup looks.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Choose a brush for the area you are working on. Clean brushes regularly with a suitable brush cleanser and allow them to dry fully.</p></details></div></article>{% endif %}</div><p class="demo-footnote">Concept products with AI-generated images and sample prices. Import the included product CSV to create catalogue entries, or select your own collection in the theme editor.</p>{% endif %}</div></section>{% schema %}{"name": "Featured collection", "settings": [{"type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Your next favourites"}, {"type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Collection"}, {"type": "range", "id": "limit", "label": "Product count", "min": 4, "max": 12, "step": 1, "default": 10}], "presets": [{"name": "Featured collection"}]}{% endschema %}